LOCATION:Mendham\, NJ\, 07945
DESCRIPTION:New Jersey Estate snd Moving Sales has the privilege of presen
 ting the three day sale of a noted local art and antiques collector. His 
 collections are vast and without question a rare public offering. CASH ON
 LY. NO pricing revealed prior to sale date. At the homeowner’s request\
 , this is a CASH ONLY sale.\nThe works of the following artists are avaia
 ble:\nWilliam E Baum\, George Nemethy\,  Alice Judson\, Robert Loftin New
 man\, Lucille Hobbie\, F W Loven\, Louis Saphier\, John Rollin Tilton\, W
 illiam A Harper\, Victor de Grailly\, Will Hinds\, Leon Louis Dolce\, Leo
 n Moran\, Daniel Charles Grose\, Arthur Faber\, etching by Dali “ Autum
 n”\, Bayard H Tyler\, Kenneth Smallwood\, Alfred De Breanski\, Hamilton
  Jay\, local artist Roger Flynn\, Dirck Stoop\, Fredrick Kost\, John Fran
 cis Murphy among others. No pricing revealed prior to sale date.\nPeriod 
 furniture such as English linen press\, Empire vanity\, English dressing 
 table/stand\, several chests\, drop leaf and tilt top tables\, game table
 \, 12 ft English dining table\, heavily carved inlaid sideboard\, fabulou
 s carved twin beds\, tiger maple ( Swedish?) chest of drawers\, sleigh/da
 y bed\, secretaries\, sewing stands\, etc.\nOf Special Interest: Cityscap
 e style table after Paul Evans\nBarometers by Preston and Tanger\, many r
 eligious artifacts\, polychrome sphinx\, large selection of African art a
 nd wood sculptures\, holy water fonts\, fireplace items including Richard
  Clancy duck andirons\, English and Asian tea caddies.\nNo pricing reveal
 ed prior to sale date. CASH ONLY.\nMany mirrors featuring one ornate circ
 ular convex mirror with carved laurel leaf motif and black ebonized inner
  rim.\nVintage and current books on cooking\, gardening\, african art\, a
 ntique furniture\, reference\, silver\, auction catalugues\, etc.\nChina 
 and crystal to include Green Derby Panel by Royal Crown Derby\, antique D
 erby pieces\, huge selection of Rose Medallion\, Fukagawa by Tiffany & Co
 \, Davenport Longport\, Adams Calyxware Lowestoft\, Wedgwood\, Minton\, L
 imoges\, Aynsley & Sons service plate\, large selection of Booths Old Wil
 low\, Flow Blue Cashmere and more. Crystal including large sets of Tiffan
 y Gilbert\, English Hobnail\, Lenox and Mikasa\, etc.\nLamps and lighting
  to include cut crystal candelabras\, sconces\, wooden bead chandelier\, 
 brass lamps and lighting\, various other chandeliers\, Satsuma lamps\, et
 c.\nGilt bronze mantle clocks\, grandfather clock (as is)\, fine rugs\, e
 tc.\nAddress will not be revealed until two hours before the opening of s
 ale. Absolutely no early buying. No prices revealed before the sale. Plea
 se check back often as more descriptions and additional pictures will fol
 low as we get closer to the date of sale. We will ship for our out-of-sta
 te customers.Finally\, again please do not call for pricing. No pricing w
 ill be revealed before the sales date. CASH ONLY. Thank you.
